{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0074_1000_p", "source_sha256": "15887b8ff6e0cc403b1f10ed9b4de0230a023dd3465dfdbaf5106ddd737e547b", "ja": "（今日のステージ。桃子は恋の歌を見事に\n歌い上げ、大きな歓声の中、ライブは幕を閉じた）", "zh": "（桃子在今天的表演中漂亮唱出恋爱的歌曲，\n演唱会就在观众热烈的欢呼声中落幕了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0074_1001_p", "source_sha256": "a3028c492ceb57e49c2fd1c5d963a535190812ea8226ac6f40cb7aacba4d10a2", "ja": "桃子、お疲れさま。いい感じだったぞ！", "zh": "桃子，辛苦了，感觉很不错喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0074_1002_049mom", "source_sha256": "fe2da24c714f75601e375696caa3df2578ece3c11ad882993035b4442c5e55f8", "ja": "もう……お兄ちゃん、今さら何言ってるの？\n桃子はプロなんだから、これくらいできて当然だよ。", "zh": "受不了……大哥哥，事到如今你还说这个做什么？\n桃子是专业的，做到这些是理所当然的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0074_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "a5b3c191a47e0afc3e77b57ee19d04be322707886135e738ec0f3b9f3edf32a5", "ja": "それに、桃子にこの歌を選んだのはお兄ちゃんでしょ？\n恋の歌なんて、最初はちょっとビックリしたけど……。", "zh": "而且，选这首歌给桃子的人不就是大哥哥吗？\n桃子一开始挺惊讶为什么会是恋爱的歌曲……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0074_1004_p", "source_sha256": "4a857cceba9da4c348d5c8864be8c40fca8d55e89d63bf7286bae93e568195fc", "ja": "でも、思った以上に合ってたよ。\nお客さんも、みんな桃子の歌に聴き入ってたし。", "zh": "不过，比预期的还要更适合桃子。\n观众们也听桃子的歌听得如痴如醉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0074_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "f79bb867e69f59c465d8753f29116d71cea40ae9a820b59f2f0d54ff40e29fe8", "ja": "ふふん。桃子は、女優だからね。\n歌うためのイメージトレーニングは、ばっちりだよ！", "zh": "哼哼，桃子可是女演员，\n为了歌曲做的想像训练是完美无缺的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0074_1006_p", "source_sha256": "eaedde58f17621e5cf04663be10d113f92a2af3bfc1c32453d2000e104bf26bc", "ja": "そうか……ちなみに今回は、\nどんなイメージトレーニングをしたんだ？", "zh": "这样啊……顺道问问，\n你这次做了怎样的想像训练？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0074_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "dc5c208dc19034521f649a7fec7196a767b5bd55bb8da2e093f732d590a1b4e6", "ja": "もちろん、『源氏物語』のイメージだよ！\n桃子は、紫式部の役だったからね。", "zh": "当然是《源氏物语》啊！\n毕竟桃子演的可是紫式部呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0074_1008_p", "source_sha256": "8b75d478124add6ea2363e8ebf1a71cb27b7cb6807661f626ceaacd502db29ad", "ja": "源氏物語って、帝の皇子である光源氏が\n大勢の女性と恋をする話だけど……。", "zh": "《源氏物语》讲的是天皇的皇子光源氏\n和许多女性恋爱的故事吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0074_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "a307fbb21720b09dcc5cc70d7987bec071af527ce9c40a3a87211455a18584fd", "ja": "そうだよ。光源氏ってすごくカッコイイらしいけど、\nこんなにたくさんの人を好きだなんて、浮気性だよね！", "zh": "对啊，光源氏好像很帅，\n但他喜欢的人居然这么多，真是花心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0074_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "d9db7871c0dac9a1afa7bed7e923ec72fba598a54b36cbed33aa2f2cd3993e78", "ja": "……って、思ってたんだけど。お仕事のために\nちゃんとお話を読んだら、すこし変わったかも。", "zh": "……桃子原本是这么想的，但为了工作\n仔细读完整个故事以后，对他的印象有点变了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0074_1011_p", "source_sha256": "dd9cf735b2ec5779a90b8dc8f986f81230a0d585b3c79d8ab79d4d45eac5a1eb", "ja": "へえ……そうなのか？", "zh": "哦……是这样啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0074_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "1b463d24fc6ee9eec3c98443d9add315d198f56e35f5afc183f2b6591c52ba72", "ja": "あのね、光源氏って、\n小さい時にお母さんが死んじゃったんだって。", "zh": "桃子跟你说，光源氏他呀，\n小时候就没有妈妈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0074_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "8459562ce813743852e81801661cf356654f471abf24c7b2139b951ebaa9fbae", "ja": "それで、お母さんに似てる人を好きになったけど、\nその人とは結ばれなくて。面影を求めてるんだって。", "zh": "然后他虽然喜欢上了跟妈妈相似的人，\n但却没办法跟对方厮守，一生只能一直寻求那样的影子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0074_1014_p", "source_sha256": "3c659aa49020e81c03de94de5ee2dfedbf4d4bd92839a50386174cd1b6b9b603", "ja": "寂しい人だったんだな。", "zh": "他是个很寂寞的人呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0074_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "47e680176fb753e12be0c1278e8bae0bc96a0147798040b387a229fa8f28c83c", "ja": "うん、桃子もそう思ったよ。だから今日のステージ、\nみんなの恋が叶いますようにって歌ったけど……。", "zh": "嗯，桃子也这么想。所以今天的表演，\n桃子唱歌时一方面是祈求大家的恋情都能顺利……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0074_1016_049mom", "source_sha256": "87abcfd1071257e44718ad6f843fe58cc1812f16262d90010056efdab8b8fb55", "ja": "光源氏も、寂しくなくなるといいなって思ったんだ。\n……お話の中の人だけど。", "zh": "一方面也希望光源氏不会再感到寂寞了。\n……虽然他只是虚构的人物。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0074_1017_p", "source_sha256": "3db1a5d9ee754ded1772f53248a8ed4490f55bbaf9756189723f2aad70a8a89f", "ja": "そうか。……桃子のその気持ちは、\nきっと届いたんじゃないかな。", "zh": "这样啊……我想桃子的心意，\n一定有传达给他了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0074_1018_049mom", "source_sha256": "1894060bd6adf224144bc5733fd5a2c106cabb9ad44927556c6ef15a4c7152cd", "ja": "うん……そうだといいな。", "zh": "嗯……如果是这样就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0074_1019_p", "source_sha256": "7953bc64d9c1d68a6b20ad3b3f0be042202913aa9826cb6f70084b2530e38fa2", "ja": "桃子はえらいな。撮影や今日のステージのために、\n色んな事を調べてきたんだな。", "zh": "桃子真了不起，为了拍摄和今天的表演，\n事先做了很多功课呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0074_1020_049mom", "source_sha256": "0aec94ffa568e99c476460daf945b9e50bad8f75c9f9bbecfaa1fce5a0f4c386", "ja": "も、もう……何言ってるの？　お仕事について\n事前に調べるくらい、プロなら当たり前だよ。", "zh": "受、受不了……你在说什么啊？事前做好\n工作方面的功课，是专业偶像应尽的本分。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0074_1021_049mom", "source_sha256": "d5cbdff9bd250da7df1aa90cfcdc3f4cc34a87bba6680e4e02ddac5c397891bd", "ja": "こんな当然のことで、ほめないで！\nほめるなら、「かわいかった」って言わなくちゃ♪", "zh": "不要因为这么理所当然的事情夸桃子！\n要夸的话，就夸我「你真可爱」♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0074_1022_p", "source_sha256": "632c1b85c077bf3a87c3b97e99ecc676bbdc1b49f6c1eb5c8117c62fb5824260", "ja": "もちろん、すごくかわいかったよ。\n着物風の衣装も似合ってるしな！", "zh": "这还用说，你真的非常可爱喔。\n和服风的服装穿在你身上也很美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0074_1023_049mom", "source_sha256": "372e9471c8d1388611ace5d67954301f60817fd54b50b11dbfa4d06bb9c6f487", "ja": "ふ、ふーん……そう？\nそれならいいけど……えへへ。", "zh": "哦、哦……是吗？\n那就好……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0074_1024_049mom", "source_sha256": "f74a9ba99682a2df1806352513e8c17857a6db0523e768e3799161095aabfa7c", "ja": "ふぅ。でも、なんだか疲れちゃった。お兄ちゃん、\n桃子着替えるから、ジュース取ってきて♪", "zh": "呼，但桃子是真的有点累了。大哥哥，\n桃子要换衣服了，你去拿果汁过来♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
